{
    "title": "CI/CD Variant 4 - Governance & Security Gates",
    "uid": "platform-cicd-governance",
    "description": "Pass/fail health of every release-governance check (sast-check, image-scan-check, sbom-check, policy-check) plus the break-glass bypass-merge detector, broken out per app. Stub gates are called out explicitly - see docs/governance-stubs.md - so this dashboard never implies more confidence than the underlying check actually earns.",
    "tags": ["platform-cicd", "cicd-variant"],
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "editable": true,
    "time": { "from": "now-7d", "to": "now" },
    "refresh": "1m",
    "templating": {
        "list": [
            {
                "name": "app_namespace",
                "type": "query",
                "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
                "query": "label_values(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count, exported_namespace)",
                "includeAll": true,
                "multi": true
            }
        ]
    },
    "panels": [
        {
            "id": 100, "type": "text", "title": "",
            "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 3 },
            "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "**Gate reality check**: `sast-check` looks up a real, cryptographically-attested Semgrep result from SLSA provenance (no re-scan). `image-scan-check` re-runs Trivy for real (vuln DBs update continuously). `sbom-check` verifies a real cosign SBOM attestation. `policy-check` verifies a real gitsign commit signature. `bypass-merge-check` is a real break-glass audit trail, not a blocking gate. None of these are the old platform's `exit 0` stubs - see docs/governance-stubs.md and docs/provenance-policy.md for exactly what each one actually verifies." }
        },
        { "id": 101, "type": "row", "title": "Gate pass rate (7d)", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 3, "w": 24, "h": 1 } },
        {
            "id": 1, "type": "gauge", "title": "sast-check",
            "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"sast-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"sast-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 2, "type": "gauge", "title": "image-scan-check",
            "gridPos": { "x": 4, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"image-scan-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"image-scan-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 3, "type": "gauge", "title": "sbom-check",
            "gridPos": { "x": 8, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"sbom-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"sbom-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 4, "type": "gauge", "title": "policy-check",
            "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"policy-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"policy-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "Break-glass alerts fired (7d)",
            "description": "bypass-merge-check only alerts when a merged PR's governance checks weren't all green - zero is the healthy state, not a lack of data.",
            "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short",
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "green" }, { "value": 1, "color": "red" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=\"bypass-merge-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 6, "type": "gauge", "title": "all gates combined",
            "gridPos": { "x": 20, "y": 4, "w": 4, "h": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=~\"sast-check|image-scan-check|sbom-check|policy-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=~\"sast-check|image-scan-check|sbom-check|policy-check\"}[7d]))" } ]
        },
        { "id": 102, "type": "row", "title": "Failures over time and by app", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 10, "w": 24, "h": 1 } },
        {
            "id": 7, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Gate failures per day, by gate",
            "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 11, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum by (pipeline) (increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=~\"sast-check|image-scan-check|sbom-check|policy-check\",status=\"failed\"}[1d]))", "legendFormat": "{{pipeline}}" } ]
        },
        {
            "id": 8, "type": "table", "title": "Governance status by app (7d)",
            "description": "One row per app+gate. Sort by pass rate to find who needs help getting green.",
            "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 11, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [ { "expr": "sum by (exported_namespace, pipeline) (increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=~\"sast-check|image-scan-check|sbom-check|policy-check\",status=\"success\"}[7d])) / sum by (exported_namespace, pipeline) (increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_pipelinerun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",pipeline=~\"sast-check|image-scan-check|sbom-check|policy-check\"}[7d]))", "format": "table", "instant": true } ],
            "transformations": [ { "id": "organize", "options": { "renameByName": { "exported_namespace": "App Namespace", "pipeline": "Gate", "Value": "Pass rate" } } } ],
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1,
                "custom": { "cellOptions": { "type": "gauge", "mode": "gradient" } },
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "red" }, { "value": 0.7, "color": "yellow" }, { "value": 0.9, "color": "green" } ] } } }
        },
        { "id": 103, "type": "row", "title": "Build-time scan gates (shift-left)", "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 24, "h": 1 } },
        {
            "id": 9, "type": "bargauge", "title": "sast-scan / image-scan / generate-sbom outcomes in the build pipeline (7d)",
            "description": "These run inside the build pipeline itself (before the release-time governance checks) and post real findings to Slack - see docs/design-language.md and the notifications.slack.scanResults toggle.",
            "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 21, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
            "options": { "displayMode": "gradient", "orientation": "horizontal", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
            "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "min": 0,
                "thresholds": { "steps": [ { "value": 0, "color": "green" } ] } } },
            "targets": [
                { "expr": "sum by (task, status) (increase(tekton_pipelines_controller_taskrun_duration_seconds_count{exported_namespace=~\"$app_namespace\",task=~\"sast-scan|image-scan|generate-sbom\"}[7d]))", "legendFormat": "{{task}} ({{status}})" }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
